  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till m&#xe4;nniskor som f&#xf6;rlorat sin sk&#xf6;rd i &#xf6;versv&#xe4;mningarna 2010 i  Benin. Genom kontant&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ringar och kontanter f&#xf6;r arbete, kommer     mottagarna har pengar att k&#xf6;pa mat och m&#xf6;jligheter att rehabilitera   sin mark.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to people who lost their harvest in the floods of 2010 in     Benin. Through cash transfers and cash for work, the beneficiaries    will have funds to purchase food and opportunities to rehabilitate    their lands.</narrative>
  </description>
